* Parallelism with named threads: maintain a conversation while navigating a list.
Goal: Find a contact while speaking
. Goal: Navigate list
.. Also: Search contact list as visual
... Search for <contact name>
... Look at <contact name>
. Goal: Continue conversation
.. Also: Speak with caller as speech
... Hear <caller question>
... Think of <answer>
... Say <answer>
. Goal: Select contact
.. Touch <contact name>
.. Verify <contact name> is selected
